    "detailed_description": "Will you defend your weak ones from the underground Orkish horde and their evil bosses? Deploy upgraded high-tech weaponry on fragile power-supply rings. Fine-tune your tower placement and costs. Incredible journey around the world never ends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/c966f239ddca1f522826a2c886c9ab06.webp?t=1737999547\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique from other TD games are rings!</li></ul>If you lose the ring beneath the tower, the deploying place is also lost. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/527ce9d3178df2182ee01759ab65c873.poster.avif?t=1737999547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/527ce9d3178df2182ee01759ab65c873.webm?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/527ce9d3178df2182ee01759ab65c873.mp4?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Regular updates!</li></ul>This is a live game and updates are coming regularly.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Long and surprising campaign!</li></ul>40 unique levels with various environments. Endless mode and Hard difficulty.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 7 diverse Towers!</li></ul>Machine Gun, Flame, Tank, Medic, Bank, Tesla and Rocket<br>3 levels of upgrade. The last upgrade also unlocks the extra functionality of a tower.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 Special Weapons!</li></ul>Nuke, Shields, and Sniper.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/3247f5da846bb3726166fdd7b43e60c2.poster.avif?t=1737999547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/3247f5da846bb3726166fdd7b43e60c2.webm?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/3247f5da846bb3726166fdd7b43e60c2.mp4?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Upgrade Towers and Special Weapons!</li></ul>Based on your performance you earn coins that you use to upgrade weaponry before battle.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10+ Enemies!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bosses! </li></ul>Strong bosses at the end of every world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story</li></ul>Follow the story to learn more about the Massive Defense universe.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play Offline!</li></ul>Single-player game, no need for WiFi.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Have fun!|</li></ul>This game has the appetite to be on top with the best tower defense games. Always polishing and making it better.<br>Intention it to make it worth your time and do not use fillers, only tasty game juice!",
    "about_the_game": "Will you defend your weak ones from the underground Orkish horde and their evil bosses? Deploy upgraded high-tech weaponry on fragile power-supply rings. Fine-tune your tower placement and costs. Incredible journey around the world never ends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/c966f239ddca1f522826a2c886c9ab06.webp?t=1737999547\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique from other TD games are rings!</li></ul>If you lose the ring beneath the tower, the deploying place is also lost. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/527ce9d3178df2182ee01759ab65c873.poster.avif?t=1737999547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/527ce9d3178df2182ee01759ab65c873.webm?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/527ce9d3178df2182ee01759ab65c873.mp4?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Regular updates!</li></ul>This is a live game and updates are coming regularly.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Long and surprising campaign!</li></ul>40 unique levels with various environments. Endless mode and Hard difficulty.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 7 diverse Towers!</li></ul>Machine Gun, Flame, Tank, Medic, Bank, Tesla and Rocket<br>3 levels of upgrade. The last upgrade also unlocks the extra functionality of a tower.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 Special Weapons!</li></ul>Nuke, Shields, and Sniper.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/3247f5da846bb3726166fdd7b43e60c2.poster.avif?t=1737999547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/3247f5da846bb3726166fdd7b43e60c2.webm?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235570/extras/3247f5da846bb3726166fdd7b43e60c2.mp4?t=1737999547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Upgrade Towers and Special Weapons!</li></ul>Based on your performance you earn coins that you use to upgrade weaponry before battle.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10+ Enemies!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bosses! </li></ul>Strong bosses at the end of every world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story</li></ul>Follow the story to learn more about the Massive Defense universe.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play Offline!</li></ul>Single-player game, no need for WiFi.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Have fun!|</li></ul>This game has the appetite to be on top with the best tower defense games. Always polishing and making it better.<br>Intention it to make it worth your time and do not use fillers, only tasty game juice!",
